# Copy to dns/.env (gitignored) and fill in real values. Never commit .env.

# API token, not the Global API Key: Cloudflare dashboard > My Profile >
# API Tokens > Create Token > Custom token, scoped to the zone listed
# under dns/zones/ (vantagepointcleaning.com.au). Needs:
#   Zone > Zone > Read
#   Zone > DNS > Edit
#   Zone > Single Redirect > Edit
# This zone has no `redirects:` entries and none are planned — but
# sync-dns.mjs's main() calls syncRedirects() for every zone unconditionally
# (to check the live redirect-rules list matches, even an empty desired
# list), so the token needs this permission or that check 403s and the
# whole sync fails, even though no redirect rule ever actually gets created.
# The script resolves the zone's ID by the `zone:` name in its own file —
# no zone ID/name env vars needed here.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
